        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    spot_price = 50\n    risk_free_rate = 0.04\n    time_to_maturity = 3 / 12\n    present_value_advantages = 5\n    present_value_disadvantages = 6\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    adjusted_spot_price = (\n        spot_price - present_value_advantages + present_value_disadvantages\n    )\n    forward_price = adjusted_spot_price * (1 + risk_free_rate) ** time_to_maturity\n    answer = round(forward_price, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
